{
  "name": "石牛海下沉",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [138, 139, 140],
  "source": "石牛海下沉指股价沿60日均线缓慢下滑，初期下滑斜率与60日均线接近；待庄家出货完毕后，股价转为加速下跌或补跌，因此一切冲过季均线系统的反弹都应视为出货机会。",
  "source_summary": "若股价已在60日均线下方缓慢滑落一段时间，随后再向下跌破近阶段低点，可视为石牛海下沉的加速阶段。",
  "comment": "当前输出的是偏卖出/回避侧的加速下跌识别，不把反弹交易写进主规则。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["open", "close"],
  "warmup_bars": 140,
  "indicator_type": "trend_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_long_window": 60,
    "slope_lookback": 20,
    "slide_lookback": 60,
    "slide_min_days": 20,
    "breakdown_lookback": 20,
    "signal_keep_days": 5
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_long",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_long_window",
      "description": "60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_long_ref",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "ma_long",
      "window": "$params.slope_lookback",
      "description": "向前平移后的60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_close_low",
      "op": "lowest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.breakdown_lookback",
      "description": "近阶段最低收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_close_low_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "recent_close_low",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日近阶段最低收盘价"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "accelerated_breakdown",
      "op": "breakout_down",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "recent_close_low_prev",
      "description": "在缓慢下沉后再次创收盘新低"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {"op": "compare", "left": "ma_long", "operator": "<", "right": "ma_long_ref"},
          {
            "op": "before",
            "condition": {"op": "compare", "left": "close", "operator": "<", "right": "ma_long"},
            "event": "accelerated_breakdown",
            "window": "$params.slide_lookback",
            "min_count": "$params.slide_min_days"
          },
          {"op": "condition", "event": "accelerated_breakdown"},
          {"op": "compare", "left": "close", "operator": "<", "right": "open"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算60日均线及其与slope_lookback日前的斜率比较，要求均线继续下行。",
    "在accelerated_breakdown之前，要求过去slide_lookback日内已有不少于slide_min_days天收盘位于60日线下方。",
    "当收盘价再次向下跌破近阶段最低收盘价时，视为石牛海下沉进入加速段。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以缓慢下沉后的再次破位日作为石牛海下沉信号完成日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文中的‘今日最低价就是明日最高价’属于更强的加速下跌细节，当前未单独量化。",
    "原文还强调季压/季均线系统反弹出货，当前规则只保留主下跌段识别。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= ma_long_window + slide_lookback + 1。",
    "这是一个风险识别规则，不是做多触发规则。"
  ],
  "explain": "石牛海下沉被结构化为沿60日线缓慢下滑后再度创低的加速下跌信号。"
}
